title: "You Have Got Pizza: Deluxe Edition"
abstract: "A PRG32 arcade cartridge and open teaching artifact for RV32IMC: indexed colour, firmware tiles, dirty-region rendering and an eight-voice SID-like stereo soundtrack, with a reproducible build and a Monte Carlo balance study."
